# Normalize line endings: LF in the repo *and* in the working tree on every OS.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows checks files out as CRLF while
# Prettier's `endOfLine` default stays "lf" — so `npm run format:check` flags
# every source file locally even though CI (Linux, LF checkout) passes.
# `text=auto` lets git keep detecting binary files and leave them untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
